{"id": "cosmetics/overview", "type": "cosmetics", "slug": "overview", "title": "Cosmetics: auras, edges and skins", "summary": "179 cosmetics: auras, edges and skins for weapons, armors and pendants. They change your look, never your stats.", "rarity": null, "is_overview": true, "image": null, "infobox": [], "sections": [{"id": "kinds-of-cosmetics", "heading": "Kinds of cosmetics", "blocks": [{"type": "ul", "text": "Auras : an effect around your character. Edges : an effect on the edge of your weapon. Skins for weapons, armors and pendants.", "html": "<ul> <li><strong>Auras</strong>: an effect around your character.</li> <li><strong>Edges</strong>: an effect on the edge of your weapon.</li> <li><strong>Skins</strong> for weapons, armors and pendants.</li> </ul>"}]}, {"id": "how-to-get-them", "heading": "How to get them", "blocks": [{"type": "ul", "text": "The shop (shards or Robux). Gemstones : each box holds 9 cosmetics, and one of them is a secret. See the gemstone tables of the odds hub . Rank-up rewards (a set of cosmetics per class), the battle pass, the Endless Tower leaderboard and events. Reserved cosmetics of the creator program.", "html": "<ul> <li>The shop (shards or Robux).</li> <li><a href=\"/en/w/overrank/products\">Gemstones</a>: each box holds 9 cosmetics, and one of them is a secret. See the gemstone tables of the <a href=\"/en/w/overrank/odds\">odds hub</a>.</li> <li>Rank-up rewards (a set of cosmetics per class), the battle pass, the Endless Tower leaderboard and events.</li> <li>Reserved cosmetics of the creator program.</li> </ul>"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Some cosmetics are undiscovered : their pages are blurred and ask for your help. If you find one, complete the page and remove the Undiscovered tag.", "html": "<p>Some cosmetics are <strong>undiscovered</strong>: their pages are blurred and ask for your help. If you find one, complete the page and remove the <em>Undiscovered</em> tag.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Cosmetics have a rarity colour and a few can be traded.", "html": "<p>Cosmetics have a rarity colour and a few can be traded.</p>"}]}], "media": [], "related": [{"text": "Shadow monarch aura", "href": "/en/w/overrank/cosmetics/aura-shadow", "img": "/games/overrank/items/aura-shadow.webp"}, {"text": "Inferno aura", "href": "/en/w/overrank/cosmetics/aura-inferno", "img": "/games/overrank/items/aura-inferno.webp"}, {"text": "Frostbound aura", "href": "/en/w/overrank/cosmetics/aura-frost", "img": "/games/overrank/items/aura-frost.webp"}, {"text": "Celestial halo", "href": "/en/w/overrank/cosmetics/aura-celestial", "img": "/games/overrank/items/aura-celestial.webp"}], "toc": [{"id": "kinds-of-cosmetics", "text": "Kinds of cosmetics"}, {"id": "how-to-get-them", "text": "How to get them"}], "last_edited": "Nov 2, 2026", "last_edited_by": "Awaitlab", "incomplete_at_source": false, "source": {"url": "https://overrank.awaitlab.com/en/w/overrank/cosmetics/overview", "path": "/en/w/overrank/cosmetics/overview"}, "raw_links": ["/en", "/en/forum/new", "/en/w/overrank", "/en/w/overrank/cosmetics", "/en/w/overrank/cosmetics/aura-celestial", "/en/w/overrank/cosmetics/aura-frost", "/en/w/overrank/cosmetics/aura-inferno", "/en/w/overrank/cosmetics/aura-shadow", "/en/w/overrank/cosmetics/overview/edit", "/en/w/overrank/odds", "/en/w/overrank/products"], "declared_count": null, "group_tabs_at_source": null, "links_to": ["cosmetics/aura-celestial", "cosmetics/aura-frost", "cosmetics/aura-inferno", "cosmetics/aura-shadow", "odds/index"], "linked_from": ["cosmetics/armor-celestial", "cosmetics/armor-glacier", "cosmetics/armor-gravewarden", "cosmetics/armor-inferno", "cosmetics/armor-nomad", "cosmetics/armor-operative", "cosmetics/armor-ronin", "cosmetics/armor-scarecrow", "cosmetics/armor-verdant", "cosmetics/armor-voidwalker", "cosmetics/aura-abyss", "cosmetics/aura-await-lab", "cosmetics/aura-bat-swarm", "cosmetics/aura-celestial", "cosmetics/aura-crimson", "cosmetics/aura-ember-drift", "cosmetics/aura-frost", "cosm